# HOW TO RELEASE FILE

@(#) $File: RELEASE-PROCEDURE,v 1.4 2015/02/15 22:10:33 christos Exp $

1)  Update version number in configure.ac
2)  Note the new version in ChangeLog
3)  Update README if applicable
